    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>subclass of :class:`~HTTPOk`

This indicates that the the server has fulfilled the request and
the user agent SHOULD reset the document view which caused the
request to be sent.

code: 205, title: Reset Content
</verbatim> </para>
